.build/
DerivedData/
# Where the Makefile's ios-device target and every local xcodebuild run put
# their derived data. Leaving it untracked rather than ignored put thousands of
# build artifacts into `git status`, which is what the workspace's own change
# list, the review panels, and the phone all read.
build/
tools/node_modules/
